## 📊 Frontend ↔ Backend API Mapping

| UI Page | API Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Dashboard** | `/api/v1/admin/analytics/summary` | GET | Total requests, denials, rates |
| **Tenants** | `/api/v1/admin/tenants` | GET | List all tenants |
| | `/api/v1/admin/tenants` | POST | Create tenant |
| | `/api/v1/admin/tenants/{id}` | PUT | Update tenant |
| | `/api/v1/admin/tenants/{id}` | DELETE | Delete tenant |
| **Rules** | `/api/v1/admin/rules` | GET | List all rules |
| | `/api/v1/admin/rules` | POST | Create rule |
| | `/api/v1/admin/rules/{id}` | PUT | Update rule |
| | `/api/v1/admin/rules/{id}` | DELETE | Delete rule |
| **Monitor** | `/api/v1/admin/analytics/tenants/{id}/usage` | GET | Real-time usage |
| | Gateway: `GET /api/v1/users` | GET | Test rate limit (direct call) |

